[[7,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the car is fitted with an Air\nBag system, before working on it, it is essential to carry out the\nfollowing preliminary operations: (1) turn the ignition off and\nremove the key; (2) disconnect the battery termnals and insulate\nthem; (3) wait at least 10 minutes before proceeding.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nRULES (see assembly 5508C - AIR BAG SYSTEM).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753205\">7040H10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752999\">5570T26</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Aerial amplifier/power supply</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>P25</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Open the retaining clip (2a) and disconnect the coaxial cable\n(2b).</p><p>3. Undo the fixing nut (3a) and recover the spacer (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046984.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the aerial mounting / amplifier.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046985.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the aerial mounting / amplifier.</p><p>Fit the spacer and tighten the fixing nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Aerial amplifier/power supply</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>P25</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the coaxial cable and secure it\nwith the retaining clip.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752999\">5570T26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753205\">7040H10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753323\">7065C34</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753201\">7040E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753321\">7065C30</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753212\">7040H67</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753211\">7040H66</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753210\">7040H50</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753266\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753213\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753209\">7040H38</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753208\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753218\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753207\">7040H30</a></p><p>Connect the battery terminals.</p>"]]